{%- comment -%}
  A collection grid whose cards are composed, not baked in: the section loops the collection and
  renders Horizon's native _product-card once per product, and that card's contents -- media, title,
  price, and anything else -- are merchant-editable child blocks, native and Mionas mixed.

  It rendered a Mionas-owned card block until the store unified on one card. The native card
  accepts @theme children (_product-card.liquid:34) and passes closest.product down to them
  (:9-11), so the Mionas price and add-to-cart button compose into it unchanged, and
  snippets/product-card-bridge.liquid is what gives it the Mionas look. That Mionas card block has
  since been deleted; git history holds it if the bridge's derivation is ever in question.

  This is the same shape as sections/mionas-split-panel.liquid, which owns the frame and hands each
  half to a static `group` slot the merchant fills. Here the frame is the grid and the slot is the
  card. The preset at the bottom ships a ready composition (media + title + price) so the section is
  useful the moment it is added, and every part of it can then be reordered, restyled or removed.

  WHY THIS SECTION EXISTS AT ALL:
  That reasoning is now about the section's header region rather than its cards. product-list puts a
  merchant-added block in a trailing content_for 'blocks' that renders once BELOW the grid; this
  section opens the same region ABOVE it, which is what carries the "LO MÁS VENDIDO" heading and the
  "Ver todo" button. No product-list setting moves that region, so this section still has to exist --
  it just no longer has to exist for the card's sake.

  WHY THE CARD IS A STATIC BLOCK:
  every iteration renders the same block type with the same fixed id ('static-product-card'), which
  is what sections/product-list.liquid and sections/mionas-google-reviews.liquid both do. The theme
  editor therefore shows ONE card whose settings and children govern every product in the grid -- the
  merchant composes the card once, not six times, and cannot end up with six cards that disagree.
  A static slot also cannot be removed, reordered or duplicated, so the section always has exactly one
  card design.

  Layout is delegated to snippets/resource-list.liquid exactly as product-list and
  mionas-google-reviews do it: every card is captured into one string separated by
  <!--@list/split-->, that string is split into an array, and both are handed over. resource-list
  owns grid / carousel / editorial rendering and the mobile-carousel fallback, so this file gets all
  of those layout settings without reimplementing any of them.

  There is no built-in heading or "see all" button setting. The section opens a free
  content_for 'blocks' region above the cards, so both are whatever blocks the merchant puts there --
  a Mionas: Text, a Mionas: Button -- rather than baked-in text settings duplicating what those
  blocks already do better. This mirrors mionas-google-reviews.liquid's reasoning.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign collection = section.settings.collection
  assign max_items = section.settings.max_products

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id
  endif
-%}

<div
  class="section-background{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
></div>
<div
  class="
    mionas-collection
    section
    section--{{ section.settings.section_width }}
    {% if section.settings.background_color != blank %}color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}
    section-resource-list
    spacing-style
    gap-style
  "
  style="
    {% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}
    {% render 'gap-style', value: section.settings.gap %}
  "
>
  {%- comment -%}
    Whitespace control on the tag is load-bearing: base.css hides
    .section-resource-list__content:empty, and a stray newline inside the div would be a text node
    that defeats :empty, leaving a --gap-sized hole above the cards when no block is added.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="section-resource-list__content">{%- content_for 'blocks' -%}</div>

  {%- comment -%}
    PLACEMENT IS LOAD-BEARING: these go outside the capture below, mirroring where
    snippets/product-grid.liquid:110-111 sits relative to its own children capture. Inside the loop
    they would be emitted once per product AND swept into the <!--@list/split--> payload that the
    split on the next line cuts on, corrupting the array resource-list receives.

    Needed at all because snippets/resource-list.liquid renders neither, unlike product-grid. Every
    other style the native card needs -- quick-add, swatches, variant picker, badges, buy buttons --
    blocks/_product-card.liquid:14-21 already renders itself.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% render 'product-card-styles' %}
  {% render 'product-card-gallery-zoom-details-styles' %}

  {%- capture list_items -%}
    {%- for product in collection.products limit: max_items -%}
      {%- unless forloop.first -%}<!--@list/split-->{%- endunless -%}
      <div class="resource-list__item">
        {%- comment -%}
          One fixed id for every iteration -- see "WHY THE CARD IS A STATIC BLOCK" above. The product
          travels as closest.product, which is how every child block (media, title, price, and any
          native product block the merchant adds) resolves which product it is rendering, exactly as
          sections/product-list.liquid:37-42 renders the same block type this section now does.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {% content_for 'block',
          type: '_product-card',
          id: 'static-product-card',
          closest.product: product
        %}
      </div>
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- liquid
    # Create an array from the list items to be used for different layout types
    assign list_items_array = list_items | strip | split: '<!--@list/split-->'
  -%}

  {% render 'resource-list',
    list_items: list_items,
    list_items_array: list_items_array,
    settings: section.settings,
    carousel_ref: 'mionasCollectionCarousel',
    slide_count: max_items,
    content_type: 'products',
    test_id: 'mionas-collection'
  %}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Layout (display, gaps, padding, width) is owned by the section/section-resource-list/
     spacing-style/gap-style classes, exactly as in product-list; these two rules only make the card
     fill its grid cell. Without them the card sizes to its content and a row of cards with different
     title lengths ends up with different heights. */
  .mionas-collection .resource-list__item {
    display: flex;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .mionas-collection .resource-list__item > .product-card {
    width: 100%;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Mionas: Collection",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header", "footer"]
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@theme"
    },
    {
      "type": "@app"
    },
    {
      "type": "_divider"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "t:settings.collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_products",
      "label": "t:settings.product_count",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout_type",
      "label": "t:settings.layout_type",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "grid",
          "label": "t:options.grid"
        },
        {
          "value": "carousel",
          "label": "t:options.carousel"
        }
      ],
      "default": "grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "carousel_on_mobile",
      "label": "t:settings.carousel_on_mobile",
      "default": false,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type != 'carousel' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns",
      "label": "t:settings.columns",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 6,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "mobile_columns",
      "label": "t:settings.mobile_columns",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "1",
          "label": "t:options.one_number"
        },
        {
          "value": "2",
          "label": "t:options.two_number"
        }
      ],
      "default": "2",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'grid' and section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == false }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "mobile_card_size",
      "label": "t:settings.mobile_columns",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "60cqw",
          "label": "t:options.one_number"
        },
        {
          "value": "44cqw",
          "label": "t:options.two_number"
        }
      ],
      "default": "60cqw",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' or section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == true }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns_gap",
      "label": "t:settings.horizontal_gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "rows_gap",
      "label": "t:settings.vertical_gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 24,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'grid' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.carousel_navigation",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' or section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == true }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "icons_style",
      "label": "t:settings.icon",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "arrow",
          "label": "t:options.arrows"
        },
        {
          "value": "chevron",
          "label": "t:options.chevrons"
        },
        {
          "value": "arrows_large",
          "label": "t:options.arrows_large"
        },
        {
          "value": "chevron_large",
          "label": "t:options.chevron_large"
        },
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "t:options.none"
        }
      ],
      "default": "none",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' or section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == true }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "icons_shape",
      "label": "t:settings.icon_background",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "t:options.none"
        },
        {
          "value": "circle",
          "label": "t:options.circle"
        },
        {
          "value": "square",
          "label": "t:options.square"
        }
      ],
      "default": "none",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.icons_style != 'none' and section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' or section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == true }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.section_layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "t:settings.width",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "page-width",
          "label": "t:options.page"
        },
        {
          "value": "full-width",
          "label": "t:options.full"
        }
      ],
      "default": "page-width"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "horizontal_alignment",
      "label": "t:settings.alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "flex-start",
          "label": "t:options.left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "t:options.center"
        },
        {
          "value": "flex-end",
          "label": "t:options.right"
        }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "t:settings.gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 28
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "t:settings.background_color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "t:settings.top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "t:settings.bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Mionas: Collection",
      "category": "t:categories.product",
      "settings": {
        "layout_type": "grid",
        "carousel_on_mobile": false,
        "max_products": 6,
        "columns": 4,
        "mobile_columns": "2",
        "mobile_card_size": "60cqw",
        "columns_gap": 8,
        "rows_gap": 24,
        "icons_style": "none",
        "icons_shape": "none",
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "horizontal_alignment": "center",
        "gap": 28,
        "padding-block-start": 48,
        "padding-block-end": 48
      },
      "blocks": {
        "static-product-card": {
          "type": "_product-card",
          "name": "t:names.product_card",
          "static": true,
          "settings": {
            "product_card_gap": 16,
            "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
            "border": "solid",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_color": "#ECE8E2",
            "border_radius": 16,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 16,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "card-gallery": {
              "type": "_product-card-gallery",
              "settings": {
                "image_ratio": "square",
                "border": "none",
                "border_width": 1,
                "border_opacity": 100,
                "border_color": "",
                "border_radius": 0,
                "padding-block-start": 0,
                "padding-block-end": 0,
                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                "padding-inline-end": 0
              }
            },
            "title": {
              "type": "product-title",
              "name": "t:names.product_title",
              "settings": {
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "paragraph",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "wrap": "pretty",
                "text_color": "#101413",
                "background": false,
                "background_color": "#00000026",
                "corner_radius": 0,
                "padding-block-start": 0,
                "padding-block-end": 0,
                "padding-inline-start": 16,
                "padding-inline-end": 16
              }
            },
            "price": {
              "type": "mionas-price",
              "name": "Mionas: Price",
              "settings": {
                "role": "label-lg",
                "variant": "default",
                "show_compare_at_price": false,
                "padding-block-start": 0,
                "padding-block-end": 0,
                "padding-inline-start": 16,
                "padding-inline-end": 16
              }
            },
            "add_to_cart": {
              "type": "mionas-add-to-cart",
              "name": "Mionas: Add to cart",
              "settings": {
                "variant": "primary",
                "size": "md",
                "full_width": true,
                "icon_only": false,
                "label_add": "Añadir al carrito",
                "padding-block-start": 0,
                "padding-block-end": 0,
                "padding-inline-start": 16,
                "padding-inline-end": 16
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": ["card-gallery", "title", "price", "add_to_cart"]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
